note: a map whose keys or values nothing decides
to count entries with m:
    give back the number of entries in m
to first value of m:
    for each k and v in m:
        give back v
    give back 0
to lookup with table and key:
    give back the value for key in table, or "none"
say count entries with (a map of "a" to 1)
say lookup with (a map of "a" to "b") and "a"
